commit c2aef6e8cbebd60f79555baeb9266e220f135a44 upstream.

The Asus Z97-DELUXE motherboard contains a Broadcom based Bluetooth
controller on the USB bus. However vendor and product ID are listed
as ASUSTek Computer.

